        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2009, Modern Round Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis bathroom towel hook is made out of solid brass with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for. The Sobe Series Robe Hook features concealed screw mounting for a sleek contemporary look. The modern styling means it will look good in even the most fashionable homes. A hook such as this is as useful in the kitchen as it is in the bathroom. A stylish way to hang a robe, towels, or even a lady's purse, it's a beautiful, modern way to keep things off the floor in any room.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2009-specifications.gif?v=1704354597\" width=\"567\" height=\"160\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2009 Sobe Single Robe Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Hook Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2009.pdf?v=1691095346\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2009 Sobe Single Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
